{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.org/schema.json",
  "_meta": {
    "name": "Award2026",
    "note": "Scroll-Triggered Storytelling pattern from ui-ux-pro-max --design-system (variance 10). Its Brutalism style and pink/cyan palette were rejected: brutalism specifies 'no smooth transitions', which contradicts the brief. Chapter hue progression is the pattern's 'each chapter has distinct color, building intensity'. Neutrals carry a cool blue bias so the warm half reads as a genuine shift. All accents >=7.6:1 on ground."
  },
